    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/834c3171706afba6c8b21d03268f2faf.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/834c3171706afba6c8b21d03268f2faf.webp?t=1749462127\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through His Eyes</strong> is a psychological horror experience that plunges you into the desperate reality of <strong>Thomas</strong>, a father trapped in a relentless time loop within his own home. In a world where nightmare and reality blur, every door locked and every puzzle solved draws you closer to uncovering the truth behind a haunting mystery and yet, a dark presence is determined to keep you confined.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/ccd865e4510029e08e907be7301f14aa.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/ccd865e4510029e08e907be7301f14aa.webm?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/ccd865e4510029e08e907be7301f14aa.mp4?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Loop</h2></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the way to break the cycle, unravel layers of your own history and confront the reality of your situation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/662f8d63b200dd9f69fc269553241cb5.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/662f8d63b200dd9f69fc269553241cb5.webm?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/662f8d63b200dd9f69fc269553241cb5.mp4?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Enigma</h2></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in your own house, every loop grows stranger than the last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/f0482198665e67477af0ea72d08275d0.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/f0482198665e67477af0ea72d08275d0.webm?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/f0482198665e67477af0ea72d08275d0.mp4?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Presence</h2></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone... or that is what you think...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/17ae2f4cb35a230a9bcd046d23d532f3.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/17ae2f4cb35a230a9bcd046d23d532f3.webm?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/17ae2f4cb35a230a9bcd046d23d532f3.mp4?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the labyrinth of your mind and your home. With each puzzle solved, the narrative deepens, inviting you to challenge your perceptions of truth and reality. Will you have the courage to break the cycle, see through the eyes of the past, and ultimately find a way to save your daughter, <strong>Charlotte</strong>?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/834c3171706afba6c8b21d03268f2faf.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/834c3171706afba6c8b21d03268f2faf.webp?t=1749462127\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=180 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through His Eyes</strong> is a psychological horror experience that plunges you into the desperate reality of <strong>Thomas</strong>, a father trapped in a relentless time loop within his own home. In a world where nightmare and reality blur, every door locked and every puzzle solved draws you closer to uncovering the truth behind a haunting mystery and yet, a dark presence is determined to keep you confined.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/ccd865e4510029e08e907be7301f14aa.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/ccd865e4510029e08e907be7301f14aa.webm?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/ccd865e4510029e08e907be7301f14aa.mp4?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Loop</h2></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the way to break the cycle, unravel layers of your own history and confront the reality of your situation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/662f8d63b200dd9f69fc269553241cb5.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/662f8d63b200dd9f69fc269553241cb5.webm?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/662f8d63b200dd9f69fc269553241cb5.mp4?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Enigma</h2></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in your own house, every loop grows stranger than the last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/f0482198665e67477af0ea72d08275d0.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/f0482198665e67477af0ea72d08275d0.webm?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/f0482198665e67477af0ea72d08275d0.mp4?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Presence</h2></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone... or that is what you think...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/17ae2f4cb35a230a9bcd046d23d532f3.poster.avif?t=1749462127\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/17ae2f4cb35a230a9bcd046d23d532f3.webm?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520830/extras/17ae2f4cb35a230a9bcd046d23d532f3.mp4?t=1749462127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the labyrinth of your mind and your home. With each puzzle solved, the narrative deepens, inviting you to challenge your perceptions of truth and reality. Will you have the courage to break the cycle, see through the eyes of the past, and ultimately find a way to save your daughter, <strong>Charlotte</strong>?</p>",
    "short_description": "Through His Eyes is a psychological horror game where a father, trapped in a haunting time loop, must uncover the truth and escape from his house to find his daughter but a dark presence won\u2019t let him go. Unlock doors, solve puzzles and break the cycle.",
